DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_94D4_11E5';
<p>94d4_11e5</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene E</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #00697f;">Gene H</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #00697f;"><i>horsey</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #00697f;">Gene H</span> is quite big and strong-looking, much larger than your typical fruit fly.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #9a3064;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9a3064;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, horsey, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">33,093</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">267</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">19,391</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,149</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,172</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf2ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">19,426</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1eb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">252</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #00697f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9a3064;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">33,250</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">110,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>P</b> and <b>H</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>P</b> and <b>H</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_94D4_11E5
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(252 + 267 + 19,391 + 19,426)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>39,336</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.3576 = <strong>35.76 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(252 + 267 + 2,149 + 19,391)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>22,059</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.2005 = <strong>20.05 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(252 + 267 + 2,149 + 2,172)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>4,840</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.0440 = <strong>4.40 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(252 + 267 + 2,149 + 33,093)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>35,761</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.3251 = <strong>32.51 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(267 + 2,172 + 19,426 + 33,250)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>55,115</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.5010 = <strong>50.10 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(33,093 + 33,250)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>66,343</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.6031 = <strong>60.31 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(252 + 267 + 19,391 + 19,426)</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = <sup>39,336</sup>/<sub>110,000</sub> = 0.3576 = <strong>35.76 cM</strong>
LITERAL_94D4_11E5_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
